error[DS0120]: `render` must be the last operator
  --> query:1:5
  |
1 | t | render | render chart with title = 1
  |     ^^^^^^   ----------------- this operator comes after `render`
  |
  = help: a query draws one chart: keep only the last `render`

error[DS0101]: expected a chart kind after `render`, found `|`
  --> query:1:12
  |
1 | t | render | render chart with title = 1
  |            ^
  |
  = note: the chart kinds are `table`, `timechart`, `linechart`, `areachart`, `barchart`, `columnchart`, `piechart`, `scatterchart` and `card`

error[DS0101]: expected `(` after `with`, found `title`
